# Standalone local preview by default; no shared activity writes.
# Never put a function key, identity token, or GitHub token in a VITE_* variable.
#
# Azure builds use these values behind the same-origin Entra server:
# VITE_ACTIVITY_AUTH=entra
# VITE_ACTIVITY_API_URL=/api
# VITE_BASE_PATH=/
#
# The old Function URL is network-restricted. Do not use it or connect a
# localhost browser directly to the Entra API; use its authenticated website.
